---
import BaseLayout from '~/layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import { site } from '~/data/site';

const base = import.meta.env.BASE_URL.replace(/\/$/, '');
---

<BaseLayout
  title="About Us"
  description="The history, structure, and benefits of the Northeast Ohio Alumni Chapter of The Delta Chi Fraternity."
>
  <section class="section">
    <div class="wrap">
      <p class="eyebrow">About us</p>
      <h1>Brotherhood that outlasts the chapter house</h1>
      <p class="lede">
        The Northeast Ohio Alumni Chapter of The Delta Chi Fraternity was formed for alumni from all
        Delta Chi chapters living in the Northeast Ohio area, to gather at events to celebrate
        brotherhood and social justice through philanthropic events.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section section--alt">
    <div class="wrap prose narrow">
      <h2>The history</h2>
      <p>
        The Alumni Chapter started back in the early 2000&rsquo;s and ran for a few years, but was
        closed. In 2016 a group of dedicated alumni felt the Alumni Chapter needed to be reformed.
        On October 13th, 2016 a large group of alumni gathered at Harry&rsquo;s Steakhouse in
        Independence, Ohio &mdash; the same location the original chapter formed &mdash; and
        committed to chartering the Northeast Ohio Alumni Chapter. On {site.charteredOn}, the Delta
        Chi Board of Regents approved the chartering of the current Alumni Chapter.
      </p>

      <h2>Structure</h2>
      <p>
        The Alumni Chapter is set up as a separate 501(c)(7) entity affiliated with the
        International Delta Chi Fraternity, in the same way as an undergraduate chapter. We are
        responsible for all our own tax filings and are <strong>not</strong> tax exempt in the same
        way an undergraduate chapter is. Read our <a href={`${base}/by-laws`}>chapter by-laws</a>.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="wrap">
      <h2>What are the benefits of joining?</h2>
      <div class="grid grid--2 benefit-grid">
        <div class="benefit">
          <h3>Promote friendship</h3>
          <ul>
            <li>Reconnect with brothers you went to school with</li>
            <li>Provide a welcoming environment for brothers new to Northeast Ohio</li>
            <li>Meet brothers from other undergraduate chapters who live in the area</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
        <div class="benefit">
          <h3>Develop character</h3>
          <ul>
            <li>Give back to others by participating in philanthropic events</li>
            <li>Provide leadership for undergraduate chapters</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
        <div class="benefit">
          <h3>Networking opportunities</h3>
          <ul>
            <li>Assist other Delta Chi alumni with potential job opportunities</li>
            <li>Join a network of professionals that can help you find a new role</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
        <div class="benefit">
          <h3>Mentorship</h3>
          <ul>
            <li>Give back by providing support to undergraduate chapters</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section section--alt">
    <div class="wrap prose narrow">
      <h2>What does my ${site.chapterDues} membership get me?</h2>
      <p>
        Virtual membership is ${site.virtualDues}. We invest most of our dues directly back into our
        membership:
      </p>
      <ul>
        <li>
          <strong>Discounted tickets to events.</strong> On top of the group rates we negotiate, we
          use dues to further reduce what members pay to attend.
        </li>
        <li><strong>Food at events.</strong> Appetizers are always on us.</li>
        <li>
          <strong>Speaker costs.</strong> Dues may cover expenses for speakers on professional and
          personal growth &mdash; financial consultants, career counseling, and more.
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong>Founder&rsquo;s Day.</strong> Each year the chapter coordinates a Founder&rsquo;s
          Day event to bring brothers together on our &ldquo;birthday.&rdquo;
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong>Alumni Rededication Ceremonies.</strong> We work with undergraduate chapters to
          facilitate rededications for graduating seniors and alumni who haven&rsquo;t yet taken
          part.
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong>The convention bus tour.</strong> A &ldquo;must do&rdquo; when attending a Delta
          Chi convention.
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong>IHQ dues.</strong> Like undergraduate chapters, alumni chapters pay International
          Headquarters dues. In return, IHQ provides alumni contact data, money management software,
          and other resources.
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong>Operating expenses.</strong> Postage, website, outreach, and communications.
        </li>
      </ul>

      <a class="btn btn--primary" href={site.duesUrl} rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">
        Join for ${site.chapterDues}/year
      </a>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .narrow {
    max-width: 68ch;
  }

  .benefit-grid {
    margin-top: 1.75rem;
  }

  .benefit {
    background: var(--surface-alt);
    border: 1px solid var(--rule);
    border-top: 4px solid var(--dx-red);
    border-radius: var(--radius);
    padding: 1.25rem 1.4rem 1rem;
  }

  .benefit h3 {
    margin-top: 0;
  }

  .benefit ul {
    margin: 0;
    padding-left: 1.1rem;
    color: var(--ink-soft);
    font-size: 0.95rem;
  }

  .benefit li {
    margin-bottom: 0.35rem;
  }
</style>
